{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Axenide/Ambxst/dev/docs/mods/manifest.schema.json",
  "manifestVersion": 1,
  "id": "drpezzer.roadie",
  "name": "Ambxst Roadie",
  "version": "3.0.0",
  "description": "Everything in one package. Shell start, reload and boot as one staged movement, with a farewell on reboot and power off. Monitors coming and going without a reload, a bar that follows the focused screen, staged chrome around fullscreen windows (special workspaces included), notifications on one screen. Bar and notch: frame-attached popouts, a Bluetooth widget with a battery readout, night weather glyphs, an audio routing tab in the dashboard, an Ethernet switch in the notch.for any provider, a stop button and a fix for the shell freezing once a chat is as tall as the sidebar. Icons: True Matugen Icons and True Monochrome under Theme. Mods: update checks that say when a mod needs a newer Ambxst before anything is installed, and can update Ambxst and the mods together. Also: a floating Settings window, idle dimming for laptops only or never, a permissions list that fits. Every feature has a switch or a Stock mode under Settings > Roadie. Replaces Clean Load, Multi-monitor fixes, Mod Updater, Settings Float, Bar at a Glance, Audio Routing and Tinted Icons; it cannot be enabled together with any of them.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "drpezzer",
  "authorUrl": "https://github.com/drpezzer",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/drpezzer/ambxst-mods",
  "compatibility": {
    "api": 1,
    "ambxst": ">=1.3.10 <2.0.0",
    "testedBaseCommits": [
      "bc60230283a3822eec2e23c949f44990480d0f43"
    ]
  },
  "dependencies": [],
  "conflicts": [
    "drpezzer.clean-load",
    "drpezzer.multi-monitor-fixes",
    "drpezzer.mod-updater",
    "drpezzer.settings-float",
    "drpezzer.bar-glance",
    "drpezzer.audio-routing",
    "drpezzer.tinted-icons"
  ],
  "commands": [
    "setsid",
    "git",
    "curl",
    "nmcli",
    "pgrep"
  ],
  "permissions": [
    "Spawns a small detached helper (the veil) that draws the wallpaper and frame while the shell restarts",
    "Runs `ambxst reload`, and the power menu's reboot or power off command, when you ask for them",
    "On Hyprland, retunes the window animation with `hyprctl eval` during a transition, then restores it",
    "At boot, reads the login session's service name and looks for a running locker, to decide whether to lock",
    "Reads other mods' manifests from their sources, and Ambxst's version from GitHub, when checking for updates",
    "Installs mod updates through the mod manager; runs Ambxst's installer in a terminal when you ask it to update Ambxst too",
    "Controls Bluetooth adapters and devices (BlueZ)",
    "Lists wired network devices and connects or disconnects them with nmcli; at shell start, ends `nmcli monitor` processes an earlier Ambxst daemon left behind",
    "Reads and moves audio streams with pactl and changes volumes; sets EasyEffects' output device and restarts it when asked",
    "Launches EasyEffects, pavucontrol and blueman-manager from their buttons",
    "Adds the config keys bar.systrayExclude, theme.trueMatugenIcons and theme.trueMonochromeTint",
    "Keeps its options in ~/.config/ambxst/roadie.json and small state files in ~/.local/state/ambxst and ~/.cache/ambxst"
  ],
